cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use env0 in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "env0: simulated-workspace environments for post-training LLM agents"
abstract: "env0 provides high-fidelity mock services that replicate real Google Workspace and Slack APIs with full state management and deterministic snapshot/restore, enabling safe post-training and evaluation of LLM agents in realistic, stateful, multi-service productivity workflows. env0 inherits its mock environments from ClawsBench."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BenchFlow team"
    website: "https://github.com/benchflow-ai/env0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/benchflow-ai/env0"
url: "https://github.com/benchflow-ai/env0"
license: AGPL-3.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-06-29
keywords:
